      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Rosetta OS project is a collaboration by numerous embedded, BSD, and other operating systems to build an OS-independent driver API.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It aims at helping projects in sharing source code and drivers for better hardware support.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
